# A run belongs to whoever ran it, not to this repository. The set is the
# questions and the answer key; everything an arm produces -- the record, the
# transcripts, the write-up, the built report package -- stays out.
#
# The report package especially: it is a Malloy package, and it must never
# land inside examples/storefront, where its eval_run.malloy would resolve
# duckdb.table('data/*.csv') against the STOREFRONT package root and put
# storefront itself into loadErrors.
*/runs/
run-package-*/
